<title>USA: Faulding Q1 Sept 30 shr loss shrinks.</title>
<headline>Faulding Q1 Sept 30 shr loss shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>ELIZABETH, N.J. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr  loss	 $0.04	   loss   $0.22</p>
<p> Net  loss	 700	     loss   3,300</p>
<p> Sales	     18,600		   15,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  15,065		   15,019</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Faulding Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results were restated to reflect businesses acquired in February 29, 1996. Faulding said new products introduced earlier in 1996 boosted first quarter sales, particularly the diolofenac sodium tablets for arthritis, but that rapid changes in the healthcare industry was presenting special challenges to each new quarter.</p>
